 bracket as conference champ","description":"Defending national champion Montana State received the top seed for the 24-team FCS playoffs, while Northeast Conference champion LIU (5-7) became the first playoff team with a losing record since 2017.","published":"2026-11-23T00:02:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564910/montana-state-grabs-top-seed-24-team-fcs-playoff-bracket","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest rewards DC Scottie Hazelton with contract extension","description":"Wake Forest defensive coordinator Scottie Hazelton has signed a contract extension.","published":"2026-11-22T21:20:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564902/wake-forest-rewards-dc-scottie-hazelton-extension","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-22T20:32:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the candidates and what are the priorities after TCU fired Sonny Dykes?","description":"Things started well for Dykes, but now the Horned Frogs are looking for a new coach and should have options.","published":"2026-11-22T19:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50323301/tcu-candidates-personnel-recruits","type":"Story","byline":"Eli Lederman, Max Olson and Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T19:15:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No Big Ten football teams in AP top 5 for first time since 2021","description":"A weekend of Big Ten upsets left the conference without a team in the top five of the AP Top 25 college football poll for the first time since 2021.","published":"2026-11-22T20:22:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50563638/no-big-ten-football-teams-ap-top-5-first-21","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5067875/zach-lutmer","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Lutmer"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Zach Lutmer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Lutmer","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Zach Lutmer (born November 5, 2004) is an American college football defensive back for the Iowa Hawkeyes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Lutmer attended Central Lyon High School in Rock Rapids, Iowa, where he played defensive back and quarterback. During his career he set school records for total yards, rushing yards and points scored. As a sophomore, Lutmer was the Class 2A Player of the Year after recording 1,194 passing yards, eight passing touchdowns, 1,609 rushing yards with 23 rushing touchdowns on offense and four interceptions, with two returned for a touchdown on defense. As a junior, he had 1,016 passing yards with eight touchdowns, 1,246 rushing yards with 22 touchdowns, and four interceptions with one returned for a touchdown. During his senior year he had 1,357 passing yards with 16 touchdowns, 1,562 rushing yards with 22 touchdowns and three interceptions. Lutmer committed to the University of Iowa to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Lutmer played in two games and redshirted his first year at Iowa in 2023. As a redshirt freshman in 2024, he played in all 13 games and had 14 tackles and one interception. Lutmer entered his redshirt sophomore year in 2025 as a starter."}]}}